# decision-energy artifact: i(Vdd) plateau of 25 uA vanishes with reltol<=1e-5 / abstol 1e-14 or method=gear (trapezoidal ringing); all later runs use reltol 1e-5/1e-6
# REJECTED method (unphysical): latch noise injected as a constant-gm (3 mS) parallel current source across the latch NMOS for the whole evaluate phase (also while the device is off): ff 85C sigma = 646 uV; the source acts even before Mc turns on, so this overstates the latch noise; replaced by the gate-referred estimate below
NOISE ff 85C with_latch_gm3mS gm=1363.5uS NA1=5.19e-07 mu=-18.2uV sigma=646.1uV (+-18.7) ncyc=600 span=+-0.60mV decisions1=306 
